@10000 = ~I have a Cloak of Mystra, but none of us can equip it. Can you do something about it?~

@10001 = ~I've changed my mind. Let us take another look at my inventory?~

@10002 = ~I can alter the enchantment woven into the cloak, to allow all, who derive their power from Mystra to wear it. To proceed I'll also need a Manual of Elaboration and a modest fee of 10,000 gold.~

@10003 = ~Let us proceed!~

@10004 = ~I have those Boots of Elvenkind, is there anything you can do to improve them?~

@10005 = ~It's delicate work, but if you provide me with a Cloak of Elvenkind, a pair of Boots of Speed, a pair of Boots of Stealth, also called the Worn Whispers and a copy of Manual of Elaboration, I can combine these into a single, stronger pair. It will cost you 50,000 gold.~

@10006 = ~~